---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/login.css';
import '../styles/register.css';
import { Ticket, ArrowLeft, ArrowRight, ArrowUpRight, Mail, LockKeyhole, Eye, EyeOff, ShieldCheck, CircleAlert, Check } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es-AR">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Ingresá a tu cuenta TicketYa y encontrá tu próximo gran momento."/><meta name="theme-color" content="#2055f5"/><title>Ingresar — TicketYa</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/></head>
<body class="login-page">
  <main class="login-layout">
    <section class="login-story" aria-label="Hay que estar ahí"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470229722913-7c0e2dbbafd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85" alt=""/><div class="story-shade"></div><a href="/" class="brand story-brand" aria-label="TicketYa, inicio"><span class="brand-symbol"><Ticket size={23}/></span>ticket<span>ya</span><span class="brand-dot">®</span></a><div class="story-content"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> EN VIVO SE SIENTE DISTINTO</span><h1>Hay momentos<br/>que empiezan<br/>con un <span>sí.</span></h1><p>A esa canción. A ese plan con amigos.<br/>A estar justo donde querés estar.</p><div class="story-ticket"><span class="ticket-cut"></span><div class="mini-ticket-icon"><Ticket size={28}/></div><div><strong>Tu próximo “yo estuve ahí”.</strong><span>Un buen plan te está esperando.</span></div><ArrowUpRight size={24}/></div></div><span class="story-footer">MENOS PANTALLA. MÁS HISTORIAS PARA CONTAR.</span></section>
    <section class="login-form-side" aria-labelledby="login-title"><a href="/" class="login-back"><ArrowLeft size={16}/> Volver a explorar</a><a href="/" class="brand mobile-login-brand">ticket<span>ya</span><span class="brand-dot">®</span></a>
      <div class="login-form-content"><span class="eyebrow">QUÉ BUENO TENERTE DE VUELTA</span><h2 id="login-title">Tu próximo plan<br/>empieza acá.</h2><p class="login-subtitle">Ingresá a tu cuenta y viví lo que viene.</p>
      <div id="registration-success" class="login-success" role="status" hidden><Check size={18}/><p>¡Tu cuenta ya está creada! Ingresá con tu email y contraseña.</p></div><form id="login-form" aria-labelledby="login-title"><div class="login-field"><label for="email">Email</label><div class="login-input"><Mail size={18}/><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" placeholder="vos@ejemplo.com" required maxlength="254" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false"/></div></div><div class="login-field"><label for="password">Contraseña</label><div class="login-input"><LockKeyhole size={18}/><input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Tu contraseña" required/><button id="toggle-password" type="button" aria-label="Mostrar contraseña" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="password"><Eye size={18} class="show-password-icon"/><EyeOff size={18} class="hide-password-icon"/></button></div></div>
      <div id="login-error" class="login-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden><CircleAlert size={18}/><p id="login-error-text"></p></div><p id="login-status" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <button id="login-submit" class="button button-blue login-submit" type="submit"><span id="submit-label">Ingresar a mi cuenta</span><ArrowRight size={19}/><span class="submit-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></form><p class="auth-switch">¿Todavía no tenés cuenta? <a id="register-link" href="/registro/">Creá tu cuenta <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></a></p>
      <div class="login-divider"><span></span> EL MEJOR PLAN ES ESTAR AHÍ <span></span></div><a href="/#explorar" class="browse-without-account">Seguir explorando sin ingresar <ArrowUpRight size={16}/></a><a href="/perfil/?demo=1" class="browse-without-account">Ver perfil de ejemplo <ArrowUpRight size={16}/></a><div class="login-assurance"><ShieldCheck size={17}/><span>Tu contraseña es solo tuya.<br/>Nunca la guardamos en este navegador.</span></div></div>
      <footer class="login-footer"><span>© 2026 TicketYa</span><span>Hay que estar ahí. <Check size={12}/></span></footer>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script>import '../scripts/login';</script>
</body>
</html>
